          ("🚦","4. Clear Channel Assessment (CCA)","Checks if the channel is **free before transmitting** → reduces interference.","c5",5),
          ("📶","5. Link Quality Indication (LQI)","Measures **quality of the received signal** → upper layers decide **routing or retries**.","c6",6),
